"The Fate of Earth is a species-wide chain to win Earth back from Taltos."
"Its stages are the bog, three levels of the Tower of Rizzen, and a battle on the roof."
"Winning moves Earth into the fringe of the Labyrinth instead of recycling it."
"The win brings one year of protection with sealed conduits and an anonymity shroud."
"A hidden objective to beat the Guardian lifts the reward from platinum to Diamond."
"Taltos rages at the Diamond reward, but the arbiter overrules him."
